<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Dana Voelzke has cut his rating for Brazilian cigarette maker Cia Souza Cruz Industria e Comercio SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's share price is &quot;up 30 percent (one percent outperformance relative to the Ibovespa) since we upgraded our recommendation to buy in early May and has reached our target price for YE97 of $10.78,&quot; he wrote in a June 26 report.</p>
<p>-- Souza Cruz is a unit of Britain's B.A.T Industries Plc.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed Thursday at 11.45 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
